    "record_zh": "米多莉在沃瓦倫加入台北市議員，接受潔絲敏委託，前往魏斯科尋找葛蘭倫大法師。旅途中，她因潔絲敏準備的三明治中毒，也曾在過橋時被河水沖走，幾乎溺死，並在津菈的庇護下爬上岸。此事之後，她與部分同伴發生摩擦。\n\n沃瓦倫儀式失控時，米多莉因獨自行動而被同伴質疑，之後道歉並繼續進入寂靜殿地下城。後來她前往寇林菲爾德，見證帕拉丁為救父親與芬諾爾交易；抵達麥克嵩後，又被捲入王城貴族、監牢與角鬥士比武大會的混亂。麥丁頓餘波中，她與倖存同伴重新集結，前往多侖維爾並進入妖精荒野；在多侖維爾，雷米消失的爆炸中，米多莉失去左前臂。之後她得到金屬手臂，並追查龍恩失蹤、茜卓博士皮衣與安德烈亞研究室等線索；滿月前，她與隊伍前往方努爾，面對將在滿月到來前爆發的新危機。",
    "record_en": "Midori joined the Taipei City Councilors in Vowalon, accepted Jasmine's commission, and went to Wescoe to find Archmage Granlen. During the journey, she was poisoned by sandwiches prepared by Jasmine, and she was also swept away by the river while crossing a bridge, nearly drowning before climbing ashore under Keinra's protection. After this incident, friction arose between her and some of her companions.\n\nWhen the Vowalon ritual went out of control, Midori was questioned by her companions for acting alone. She later apologized and continued into the dungeon beneath the Temple of Silence. She then went to Korringfield, witnessed Paladin bargain with Phynoir to save his father, and after reaching Macksohn was drawn into turmoil involving royal nobles, imprisonment, and the gladiator tournament. In the aftermath of Mattington, she regrouped with the surviving companions, traveled to Dorrenville, and entered the Feywild; in Dorrenville, during the explosion in which Lemmy disappeared, Midori lost her left forearm. Afterward, she received a metal arm, and she investigated Ron's disappearance, Dr. Chandra's leather coat, and clues connected to Andrea's laboratory. Before the full moon, she went with the party to Fanaur, facing a new crisis set to erupt before the full moon arrived."
