    "record_zh": "帕拉丁在沃瓦倫與台北市議員同行，參與調查詛咒、前往魏斯科、穿越嚎叫森林，並帶回葛蘭倫大法師。他經歷毒三明治、狼群戰鬥、死亡與復甦，也在沃瓦倫儀式中看見鎮民化為屍體與殭屍，之後進入寂靜殿地下城。\n\n在寇林菲爾德，帕拉丁為拯救病危的父親，割下了自己的耳朵來做月神芬諾爾的交易儀式。他也得知自己的生母是麥克嵩的紫羅蘭珊吉雅。前往麥克嵩後，他與生母相認；在王宮花園的比武大會中，他與龍恩進入總決賽，龍恩刻意激發他的鬥志並以演技倒下，最後帕拉丁仍保持清醒，被國王宣布為「膝蓋粉碎者帕拉丁」與本次比武大會總冠軍。他藉冠軍要求釋放家亨、安排同伴住處與取得地圖，並被封為新任寇林菲爾德爵士。\n\n家亨與安納戴克死後，隊伍在朗甫頓分家：米多莉等人帶波前往方努爾，帕拉丁爵士則與蘇加魯、墜兒前往瑟巴諾追查拉索斯教。在瑟巴諾，他與新夥伴進入惡棍之城，接觸霍布、深淵復活者與蜘蛛王阿爾芬諾的詛咒；眾人調查王宮圖書館、舊城區與母親大人的勢力，發現詛咒會在期限內奪命。最終，帕拉丁遭被奪舍的蜘蛛神教神明「母親大人」鑽入其體內而死去。麥丁頓王國為其舉行了國葬。",
    "record_en": "Paladin traveled with the Taipei City Councilors in Vowalon, taking part in the curse investigation, the trip to Wescoe, the crossing of the Howling Forest, and the return of Archmage Granlen. He experienced the poisoned sandwiches, the wolf battle, death and revival, and the incident in which Vowalon's ritual turned the townspeople into corpses and zombies, after which he entered the dungeon beneath the Temple of Silence.\n\nIn Korringfield, Paladin cut off his own ear to perform a ritual bargain with the moon god Phynoir in order to save his dying father. He also learned that his birth mother was Xandria, the Violet of Macksohn. After reaching Macksohn, he reunited with his birth mother. In the royal garden tournament, he and Ron reached the final match; Ron deliberately drew out Paladin's fighting spirit and used acting to fall, while Paladin remained conscious long enough for the king to declare him \"Knee-Crusher Paladin\" and champion of the tournament. As champion, he demanded Jiaheng's release, lodging for his companions, and a map, and was named the new Syr Korringfield.\n\nAfter Jiaheng and Anedak died, the party split in Rumphton: Midori and the others took Bo to Fanaur, while Syr Paladin went with Sugalu and Drayer to Sebano to investigate the Laxthos cult. In Sebano, he and his new companions entered the City of Villains, encountered Hobb, resurrection from the Deep, and the curse of the Spider King Alfenor. The party investigated the palace library, the old district, and The Mother's influence, discovering that the curse would kill its victims within a time limit. In the end, Paladin died when the possessed deity of The Spider Religion, The Mother, entered his body. The Kingdom of Mattington held a state funeral for him."
  },
