    "record_zh": "龍恩在沃瓦倫加入台北市議員，參與鎮長委託、嚎叫森林行軍、狼群戰鬥與沃瓦倫驅咒儀式。儀式失控時，他踏出黑暗與寂靜，發現周圍滿是鎮民屍體與殭屍，並與後來化身為冰原狼的烏柯衝向葛蘭倫。\n\n之後龍恩進入寂靜殿地下城，接觸洛林精神留下的訊息，並跟著隊伍逃往寇林菲爾德、麥克嵩與麥丁頓。在麥克嵩，他曾以尖頂寺武僧的身份入城，在日出酒館煎牛排並暫住為廚師；王宮花園比武大會中，他與帕拉丁一路打進總決賽，刻意激發帕拉丁鬥志，最後以演技倒下，讓帕拉丁得到冠軍。\n\n麥丁頓陷入混亂後，龍恩與同伴重新集結，在多侖維爾面對白醫師的白光、雷米消失的爆炸，以及尋找失蹤者的妖精荒野旅程。後來在大學城，他抓住偷聽眾人談論蘿琳的伊，並因伊對蘿琳的執著而懷有敵意；在安德烈亞研究室相關衝突中，他甚至把被綁住的伊與逐漸陶瓷化的梅爾文一起拖往後院。接觸禁書區與「手與眼睛」相關的書後，龍恩一度失蹤，回來時外貌變得更陰暗，說話也閃爍其詞。茜卓博士追上他後，兩人在巷弄中爆發衝突，龍恩本想擊昏茜卓，卻在爆炸後只撿到她的皮衣。眾人試圖把被綁住的龍恩帶走時，迷霧散去後只剩垂落的繩子，龍恩與茜卓博士皮衣一同不見。\n\n龍恩後來在方努爾市的津菈教堂醒來，巫妖手臂被金屬鍊暫時封住。他與瑪莉修女、巨鎚瑞斯調查尼姆孤兒院附近的中毒與失蹤，發現地下有拉索斯教徒、魔法陣與會強化死靈法術並釋放毒素的拉巴比石。瑞斯被怪物咬死後，龍恩擊倒怪物，卻發現牠變成一具衣衫破爛的小孩屍體，因而推測孤兒院可能遭拉索斯教滲透。他把瑞斯與孩子的屍體帶回聖津菈大教堂，向羅賓遜主教說明情況，並與重新抵達方努爾的同伴交換調查結果。",
    "record_en": "Ron joined the Taipei City Councilors in Vowalon and took part in the mayor's commission, the march through the Howling Forest, the wolf battle, and Vowalon's curse-breaking ritual. When the ritual went out of control, he stepped out of the darkness and silence, found the area filled with townspeople's corpses and zombies, and charged toward Granlen together with Uko, who had transformed into a winter wolf.\n\nRon later entered the dungeon beneath the Temple of Silence, encountered messages left by the spirit of Lorin, and fled with the party toward Korringfield, Macksohn, and Mattington. In Macksohn, he entered the city as a monk from Peak Temple, cooked steak at the Sunrise Tavern, and briefly settled there as a cook. At the royal garden tournament, he and Paladin fought their way into the final match; Ron deliberately drew out Paladin's fighting spirit, then used acting to fall so Paladin could be declared champion.\n\nAfter Mattington fell into chaos, Ron regrouped with his companions in Dorrenville, facing Dr. White's white light, the explosion that made Lemmy disappear, and a journey into the Feywild to search for missing people. Later in Great Citadel, he caught Yi eavesdropping on the party's discussion of Roline and became hostile because of Yi's obsession with her. During the conflict connected to Andrea's laboratory, he even dragged the bound Yi and the ceramicizing Melvin toward the backyard together. After encountering restricted books connected to the Hand and Eye, Ron disappeared for a time. When he returned, his appearance had darkened and his answers became evasive. Dr. Chandra chased him down, and the two fought in an alley; Ron intended to knock her unconscious, but after an explosion he found only her leather coat. When the party tried to lead the bound Ron away, the mist cleared and only a dangling rope remained. Ron and Dr. Chandra's leather coat had vanished together.\n\nRon later woke in a Keinra church in Fanaur City, his lich arm temporarily sealed with a metal chain. With Sister Mari and Reese the Great Hammer, he investigated poisonings and disappearances near Nimu Orphanage, finding Laxthos cultists, a magic circle, and Lababi stones that strengthened necromancy while releasing toxins. After Reese was bitten to death by a monster, Ron defeated it, only to see it become the corpse of a child in ragged clothes, leading him to suspect that the orphanage had been infiltrated by the Laxthos cult. He brought Reese's and the child's bodies back to Saint Keinra Cathedral, reported the situation to Bishop Robinson, and exchanged findings with his companions when they later arrived in Fanaur."
  },
