    "record_zh": "薩梅爾在沃瓦倫加入台北市議員，參與詛咒調查、魏斯科之行與嚎叫森林行軍。他在森林中與家亨輪流守夜，也在重返森林途中撿到一隻親近自己的幼狼，並為牠取名酷爆。沃瓦倫儀式失控後，他在虛弱中看見黑影推開寂靜殿大門，提醒眾人追入地下。\n\n地下城中，薩梅爾與被囚禁的崔夏談話，因她被背叛與囚禁的經歷想起自己的過往。之後他前往寇林菲爾德、麥克嵩與麥丁頓，見證隊伍從逃亡者變成王城比武大會的參賽者，又在同伴死亡後被迫重新分隊。後來，薩梅爾在妖精荒野遇見自己「已死」的祖母英荻格，也學會自由穿越妖精荒野與物質世界的魔法；追查龍恩失蹤、大學城與方努爾線索時，他持續作為隊伍中熟悉異界與失蹤者線索的人同行。",
    "record_en": "Samael joined the Taipei City Councilors in Vowalon and took part in the curse investigation, the trip to Wescoe, and the march through the Howling Forest. In the forest, he took turns keeping watch with Jiaheng, and on the return through the woods he found a wolf cub that had taken a liking to him, naming it Kubao. After the Vowalon ritual went out of control, he saw a black shadow push open the doors of the Temple of Silence while he was weakened, prompting the group to pursue it underground.\n\nIn the dungeon, Samael spoke with the imprisoned Trisha, whose betrayal and captivity reminded him of his own past. He later went to Korringfield, Macksohn, and Mattington, witnessing the party shift from fugitives to participants in the royal tournament and then being forced to split again after companions died. Later, Samael met his supposedly dead grandmother Indigo in the Feywild and learned magic that allowed him to move freely between the Feywild and the Material World. While the party investigated Ron's disappearance and clues tied to Great Citadel and Fanaur, he continued traveling as someone familiar with otherworldly paths and missing-person mysteries."
  },
