    "record_zh": "喜利在麥克嵩比武大會期間登場，之後加入台北市議員。麥丁頓王國陷入混亂後，他與米多莉、龍恩、薩梅爾、YHWH 等人重新集結，前往多侖維爾追查白醫師造成的白光、同伴失蹤與雷米爆炸消失的線索，又跟著隊伍進入妖精荒野、大學城與方努爾。\n\n在多侖維爾，白醫師以白光帶走多名同伴時，喜利靠意志抵抗，醒來後發現房內只剩自己與法朗茲。追查巫妖之手時，他曾獨自離開隊伍一段時間，表示需要靜一靜，晚上再於茜卓博士家會合。之後他協助調查龍恩失蹤、茜卓博士皮衣與艾麗克斯工作舖，逐步將線索指向安德烈亞研究室與被操弄的失蹤案。滿月前，他在深夜隱約聽見聲音提醒，有人跟著他們上了船。",
    "record_en": "Siri appeared during the Macksohn tournament and later joined the Taipei City Councilors. After the Kingdom of Mattington fell into chaos, he regrouped with Midori, Ron, Samael, YHWH, and others, went to Dorrenville to investigate Dr. White's white light, missing companions, and clues from the explosion in which Lemmy disappeared, then followed the party into the Feywild, Great Citadel, and Fanaur.\n\nIn Dorrenville, when Dr. White used white light to take away several companions, Siri resisted through willpower. After waking, he found that only he and Franz remained in the room. During the Hand of the Lich, he left the party alone for a time, saying he needed quiet and would regroup at Dr. Chandra's house that evening. Afterward, he helped investigate Ron's disappearance, Dr. Chandra's leather coat, and Alex's workshop, gradually tying the clues to Andrea's laboratory and manipulated disappearances. Before the full moon, he faintly heard a voice late at night warning him that someone had followed them onto the ship."
  },
