    "record_zh": "圖伊特在麥丁頓破碎篇登場，與帕拉丁、蘇加魯、華生等人走入惡棍之城瑟巴諾。在那裡，他接觸霍布、深淵復活者與被詛咒的倖存者，之後透過王宮圖書館的書籍追查蜘蛛王阿爾芬諾，也在王宮與貓頭鷹奧利佛同行，目睹奧利佛被衛兵殺死。\n\n圖伊特接著進入劇院地下，面對重生的母親大人與冒險者複製體，並逐漸逼近蜘蛛神教、母親大人與深淵詛咒的真相。後來隊伍前往洛森王國，月光狩獵會襲擊時，他失去意識並在黑暗中聽見宗主的聲音，醒來後得知攻擊者是月神支派。洛森深處的旅途中，他見證羅特與新的孵化夥伴被捲入危機。最終，圖伊特在異變的母親大人屠殺中，與芬諾爾做交易，以自己存在的現實與記憶，換取羅特的安危。",
    "record_en": "Tweeter appeared in the Shattered Mattington arc and entered Sebano, the City of Villains, with Paladin, Sugalu, Watson, and others. There, he encountered Hobb, resurrection from the Deep, and cursed survivors. He then used books in the palace library to investigate the Spider King Alfenor, and traveled in the palace with the owl Oliver, witnessing Oliver being killed by guards.\n\nTweeter next entered the theater basement, faced The Mother after her rebirth and clones of the adventurers, and gradually moved closer to the truth behind The Spider Religion, The Mother, and the curse of the Deep. Later, the party went to the Kingdom of Losen. During the Moonlight Hunt attack, he lost consciousness and heard the patron's voice in the darkness; after waking, he learned that the attackers belonged to a branch of the moon god. Deep in Losen, he witnessed Lott and a newly hatched companion being drawn into crisis. In the end, during The Mother's massacre in her transformed state, Tweeter made a bargain with Phynoir, exchanging the reality and memory of his own existence for Lott's safety."
  },
  {
