    "record_zh": "伊是M伯爵手下的情報員。他在阿爾芬諾之禮篇出現，協助隊伍理解麥丁頓災後的勢力局勢，並投入對母親大人、M伯爵與蜘蛛王詛咒的調查。她曾與伊努、帕拉丁、蘇加魯、圖伊特、華生等人一同行動，討論救援計畫，面對被母親大人操弄的居民、貴族與深淵線索。\n\n之後伊短暫出現在潛伏危機與洛森王國的旅程中，包含劇院地下調查、月光狩獵會襲擊，以及冒險者逐步接近母親大人真相的過程。覆羽莊園中，她也在過往命運被重演的段落裡再度出現，讓羅特面對自己失去過的同伴與記憶。\n\n後來，伊在眾人追查巫妖之手時再度登場，透露自己計畫潛入安德烈亞的研究室拯救蘿琳；龍恩在衝突中將他敲暈，波則扛著昏迷的伊前往目的地。",
    "record_en": "Yi was an intelligence agent under Count M. She appeared in the Gift of Alfenor arc, helped the party understand the power situation after the Mattington disaster, and joined the investigation into The Mother, Count M, and the Spider King's curse. She acted alongside Inu, Paladin, Sugalu, Tweeter, Watson, and others, discussing rescue plans and facing residents, nobles, and clues of the Deep manipulated by The Mother.\n\nYi later appeared briefly during the Hidden Crisis and the journey through the Kingdom of Losen, including the theater basement investigation, the Moonlight Hunt attack, and the party's gradual approach toward the truth behind The Mother. At the Feathered Estate, she also appeared again when past fate was being reenacted, forcing Lott to confront companions and memories he had lost.\n\nLater, while the party was pursuing the Hand of the Lich, Yi appeared again and revealed that she planned to infiltrate Andrea's laboratory to rescue Roline. During the conflict, Ron knocked her unconscious, and Bo carried the unconscious Yi toward the destination."
  },
