    "record_zh": "羅特原為伊照顧的孤兒小弟，在阿爾芬諾之禮後段加入冒險團隊，投入救援行動，之後進入洛森王國尋找母親大人與蜘蛛神教的真相。他在洛森學習妖精語與長笛，面對冒險者複製體、月光狩獵會與洛森深處的危機；最終，他面對所有團隊成員之死、唯有自己存活的悲劇，甚至遺忘所鍾愛的圖伊特相關記憶，被迫成長。數年後，羅特與新的冒險團隊接受神秘委託，尋找月神王冠，進入卓茲蘭之穴接觸孽物、羽王與芬諾爾傳道者，並在覆羽莊園見證委託者利希恩・阿莫雷躍升成永恆與愛之神。\n\n覆羽莊園後，羅特與烏波、賽柏沿著烏波的直覺前往斐納札；GoR 在抵達前一夜失蹤。斐納札中，羅特以單音節化名「蘭」行動，接觸譚，調查衣服顏色、議會與工作制度。他對芬諾爾信仰產生排斥，並透過覆羽莊園取得的面具與愛神阿莫雷特締約。派琶預示篇中，他追尋賽柏下落，並照顧從死亡邊緣回歸的佛拉。\n\n當芒果以巨蛇姿態襲擊常翠林總部時，羅特面對自己曾照養的小蛇，仍選擇與夥伴們共同對抗，目睹芒果最終死去。",
    "record_en": "Lott was originally an orphan younger brother cared for by Yi. He joined the adventuring party in the later part of the Gift of Alfenor, joined the rescue operation, and later entered the Kingdom of Losen to search for the truth behind The Mother and The Spider Religion. In Losen, he learned Sylvan and the flute while facing clones of the adventurers, the Moonlight Hunt, and dangers deep within the kingdom. In the end, he faced the tragedy in which every member of the party died and only he survived, and he even forgot memories related to Tweeter, whom he loved, forcing him to grow up. Years later, Lott and a new adventuring party accepted a mysterious commission to search for the moon god's crown, entered the Cave of Drogsland, encountered the wretched creatures, the Feather King, and Phynoir missionaries, and at the Feathered Estate witnessed his client Lysien Amoret ascend as the god of eternity and love.\n\nAfter the Feathered Estate, Lott, Ubbo, and Psyber followed Ubbo's intuition toward Fenadra; GoR disappeared the night before they arrived. In Fenadra, Lott operated under the single-syllable alias \"Lan,\" contacted Tan, and investigated clothing colors, the council, and the work system. He developed aversion toward the faith of Phynoir, and made a pact with the god of love Amoret through the mask obtained at the Feathered Estate. In Py'Par's Vision, he pursued Psyber's whereabouts and cared for Phola after she returned from the edge of death.\n\nWhen Mango attacked the Evergreen headquarters in the form of a giant serpent, Lott faced the little snake he had once cared for, chose to fight alongside his companions, and witnessed Mango's final death."
  },
