    ],
    "record_zh": "阿龍在貿易之都貝瑟頓開始冒險，與毛毛、鑰、雷亞、羅羅一同接觸幽深林與 T.I.D.E.S. 相關線索。他在酒館詢問菸草，拿出父親留下的小煙斗試抽，也在幽深林與海妖墓場中面對骷髏與歌聲。\n\n在第1410頁書店，鑰讀到《喬里森與其神話》中「從河流漂下的孩子是喬里森選中之子」的內容，與阿龍以蛋的形態順流而來的身世相符。之後阿龍接受里奇蒙爵士引介，接觸 T.I.D.E.S. 的組織與天選者集會；他進入宴會與集會場合，目睹萊里被逐出方尖碑與 T.I.D.E.S.，也看見冒險者被要求離場。\n\n在土城風暴中，阿龍回到從小長大的家鄉「土城」，與父母相見、與青梅竹馬佩妮重逢，卻得知春天精靈投票、翠綠印記與海雅特山山賊之間有秘密交易。他與同伴上山後發現所謂山賊其實受更大犯罪組織壓迫；最後在雨夜的議會前，阿龍被逐出土城，剝奪其姓氏。\n\n後來阿龍前往拉撒拿，見到自己的原生家庭，卻在與銀龍對話的隔天目睹父母之死。冒險團查出堂妹奈梨莎涉入罪行後，阿龍以本名賽拉尼爾・艾瑞利斯繼任拉撒拿龍冠，並親自宣判奈梨莎被逐出拉撒拿。\n\n阿龍在與冒險者們來到克萊芬時，接獲情敵大奧斯的消息，而趕回拉撒拿，暫時離開了冒險團。",
    "record_en": "Al-lon began his adventure in the trade city of Batherdon, encountering clues related to the Deepwood and T.I.D.E.S. together with Fur, Kaname, Leah, and Roel. At a tavern, he asked about tobacco and tried smoking the small pipe left by his father. In the Deepwood and the Siren Graveyard, he faced skeletons and song.\n\nAt Page 1410 Books, Kaname read a passage in Jeorisan and His Myths saying that a child drifting down the river was the chosen child of Jeorisan, which matched Al-lon's origin of arriving downstream in egg form. Al-lon then accepted Syr Richmond's introduction, learned about T.I.D.E.S. and the Chosen gathering, entered banquets and meetings, saw Riley expelled from the Obelisk and T.I.D.E.S., and watched the invited adventurers be asked to leave.\n\nDuring the Storm of Mudtown, Al-lon returned to Mudtown, the hometown where he had grown up, met his parents, and reunited with his childhood friend Penny. He learned that the Spring Spirit vote, the verdant mark, and the Mount Hyatt bandits were tied together by a secret arrangement. After going up the mountain with his companions, he discovered that the so-called bandits were being pressured by a larger criminal organization. In the end, on a rainy night before the council, Al-lon was expelled from Mudtown and stripped of his surname.\n\nAl-lon later went to Rathanad and met his birth family, but the day after speaking with the silver dragon, he witnessed his parents' deaths. After the adventuring party uncovered his cousin Nylessa's involvement, Al-lon inherited the dragon crown of Rathanad under his true name, Selaniel Arylith, and personally sentenced Nylessa to exile from Rathanad.\n\nWhen Al-lon reached Clyphen with the adventurers, he received news about his romantic rival, Big Os, and returned to Rathanad, temporarily leaving the party."
  },
