    "record_zh": "羅羅在冒險初期以身分不明的妖精加入隊伍，同行者一度懷疑他可能是通緝犯。他表示自己的許多行動與神秘的「祂」有關。貝瑟頓期間，他與雷亞前往糖果店與破舊甜點店，購買大量甜食。\n\n隊伍前往幽深林與海妖墓場時，羅羅以遠距離攻擊協助同伴擊倒骷髏。之後他跟著隊伍接觸 T.I.D.E.S. 與天選者集會，進入宴會並見證組織高層變動；土城風暴中，他聽見春天精靈、山賊與翠綠印記的真相，也與隊伍上山接觸受壓迫的山賊團。阿龍前往拉撒拿面對原生家庭時，羅羅也被捲入銀龍、艾瑞里斯家與龍冠繼承審判的衝突。不被承認的孩子篇中，他來到克萊芬與萊斯諾，並在土城後期與毛毛於掛衣間偷聽老樹盟與市民連線的刺殺計畫；之後又在拉比帶領下於夜間外出調查利斯達上校相關線索。",
    "record_en": "Roel joined the party early in the adventure as a fey of unknown identity, and his companions once suspected that he might be a wanted criminal. He said that many of his actions were connected to the mysterious \"Him.\" During the Batherdon period, he went with Leah to a candy shop and an old dessert shop, buying large amounts of sweets.\n\nWhen the party traveled to the Deepwood and the Siren Graveyard, Roel helped his companions defeat skeletons with ranged attacks. He later followed the party into contact with T.I.D.E.S. and the Chosen gathering, attended banquets, and witnessed changes among the organization's leadership. During the Storm of Mudtown, he learned the truth behind the Spring Spirit, the bandits, and the verdant mark, and went up the mountain with the party to meet bandits trapped under pressure from a larger group. When Al-lon went to Rathanad to face his birth family, Roel was also drawn into conflicts around the silver dragon, the Arylith family, and the dragon-crown succession judgment. During the Unacknowledged Child arc, he came to Clyphen and Leisnor, and late in Mudtown he and Fur eavesdropped in a coatroom on the Old Tree League and Citizens' Line assassination plan; later, under Ravi's guidance, he went out at night to investigate clues related to Colonel Lisdar."
  },
