    "record_zh": "鑰在乘著推車同行，從貝瑟頓到幽深林一路照顧同伴。她安置被雷亞抓到的松鼠頹哥，並將牠命名為嘎吱爵士，使牠在推車中安定下來。海妖墓場戰鬥中，她以輔助協助隊伍擊倒骷髏。\n\n之後鑰接觸 T.I.D.E.S. 的邀請與天選者集會，從里奇蒙爵士與宴會場合中得知組織架構與高層變動。土城風暴中，她協助查明春天精靈、翠綠印記與山賊制度，並取得山賊財務紀錄，理解他們受更大犯罪組織壓迫。阿龍前往拉撒拿面對原生家庭時，她陪同他接觸銀龍與奈梨莎審判；不被承認的孩子篇中，她進入克萊芬與萊斯諾的政治衝突。土城後期，她以傳訊術聯絡被送往診所的拉比，讓拉比得知皮尼歐教授遇刺、城市陷入動亂。",
    "record_en": "Kaname traveled along with a cart, caring for her companions from Batherdon to the Deepwood. She settled the squirrel that Leah had caught, Twiggle, named it Sir Squeak, and helped it calm down in the cart. In the Siren Graveyard battle, she supported the party in defeating the skeletons.\n\nKaname later encountered the T.I.D.E.S. invitation and the Chosen gathering, learning about the organization's structure and leadership changes through Syr Richmond and the banquet gatherings. During the Storm of Mudtown, she helped uncover the Spring Spirit, the verdant mark, and the bandit system, and obtained the bandits' financial records, learning that they were being pressured by a larger criminal organization. When Al-lon went to Rathanad to face his birth family, she accompanied him as he encountered the silver dragon and Nylessa's judgment; in the Unacknowledged Child arc, she entered the political conflict of Clyphen and Leisnor. Late in Mudtown, she used Sending to contact Ravi, who had been taken to a clinic, letting him know that Professor Peneo had been assassinated and that the city had fallen into unrest."
  },
