    "record_zh": "巴斯在月蝕之席篇加入冒險團，與羅特、烏波等人面對斐納札後續與賽柏失蹤的狀況。派琶的預示篇中，他扛著虛弱的羅特，跟著烏波追尋賽柏留下的痕跡，進入一座不斷提醒外人「別在夜晚離開這裡」的村莊。\n\n在村莊裡，巴斯與村民、孩子互動，教一名年輕人玩牌，也與烏波討論村莊的古怪處。離開村莊後，他繼續與羅特、烏波前往派琶所在之處，揭開面具下隱藏的真相，得知巨蛇威脅正逼近常翠林。旅途中，羅特治療敵人佛拉時，巴斯對這個決定感到不滿，並當場質問羅特。\n\n在常翠林總部，他與弗雷多確認賽柏的狀況，並在芒果襲擊時率先撞開大門迎戰。戰後，弗雷多告知他派翠克的遺體被挖走，巴斯因此邀請夥伴們一同前往石原鎮。",
    "record_en": "Buzz joined the adventuring party in the Seat of the Lunar Eclipse arc, facing the aftermath of Fenadra and Psyber's disappearance together with Lott, Ubbo, and others. In Py'Par's Vision, he carried the weakened Lott, followed Ubbo in tracing the signs left by Psyber, and entered a village that repeatedly warned outsiders not to leave at night.\n\nIn the village, Buzz interacted with the villagers and children, taught a young person to play cards, and discussed the village's oddities with Ubbo. After leaving the village, he continued with Lott and Ubbo toward Py'Par's location, uncovered the truth hidden beneath the mask, and learned that the threat of a giant serpent was closing in on the Evergreen. During the journey, when Lott treated the enemy Phola, Buzz was dissatisfied with that decision and questioned Lott on the spot.\n\nAt the Evergreen headquarters, he confirmed Psyber's condition with Fredo, then broke open the door first when Mango attacked. After the battle, Fredo told him that Patrick's body had been dug up, leading Buzz to invite his companions to travel with him to Stonefield."
  },
