    "record_zh": "冒險團在前往洛森時遇見帕斯卡，得知他是帕拉丁的兄弟；他聽聞帕拉丁在麥克嵩死亡的消息後，前往洛森尋找可能知道帕拉丁消息的人，並在途中與冒險者相遇。\n\n帕斯卡之後與羅特、蘇加魯、圖伊特等人一同行動。當時隊伍正在洛森王國內尋找蜘蛛神教與母親大人的線索，也得面對非妖精在洛森過夜可能遭遇危險的問題。月光狩獵會襲擊時，他與隊伍陷入月神支派的攻擊與失憶般的黑暗；後續他見證新孵化夥伴加入隊伍，並持續追查母親大人、蜘蛛神教與洛森深處的危機。抵達母親大人的巢穴後，帕斯卡在洞內撿起弟弟帕拉丁的臉皮，小心收進包包；當異變的母親大人開始屠殺時，他試圖逃跑並用狼牙棒劈開由小蜘蛛堆成的牆，卻被觸手刺穿腹腔與心臟，死在羅特面前。",
    "record_en": "The adventuring party met Pascal on the way to Losen and learned that he was Paladin's brother. After hearing that Paladin had died in Macksohn, he went to Losen to search for people who might know news about Paladin, and met the adventurers on the way.\n\nPascal then acted together with Lott, Sugalu, Tweeter, and others. When he joined, the party was searching within the Kingdom of Losen for clues related to The Spider Religion and The Mother, while also facing the danger that non-fey might encounter if they spent the night in Losen. During the Moonlight Hunt attack, he and the party were caught in an assault by a branch of the moon god and a darkness like lost memory. He later witnessed a newly hatched companion join the party, and continued investigating The Mother, The Spider Religion, and the dangers deep within Losen. After reaching The Mother's lair, Pascal found the face of his brother Paladin lying in the cave like a piece of skin and carefully put it in his bag. When The Mother began slaughtering the party in her transformed state, he tried to flee and used his mace to break through a wall of small spiders, but The Mother's tentacles pierced his abdomen and heart, killing him in front of Lott."
  },
