    "record_zh": "雷亞加入冒險團隊，與阿龍、毛毛、鑰、羅羅一起從貝瑟頓前往幽深林。海妖墓場戰鬥中，雷亞施放雲霧術限制視線，並以近戰攻擊參與擊倒骷髏。\n\n之後雷亞接觸 T.I.D.E.S. 與天選者集會，得知方尖碑與組織高層的變動；土城風暴中，她了解春天精靈、翠綠印記與山賊之間的秘密交易，也曾向山賊中的牧師學到涅西斯教義。拉撒拿繼承人事件中，她從銀龍口中得知自己家鄉的事，並在阿龍父母遇害與奈梨莎審判後，陪伴代理龍冠瑟拉蒙談起自己從未見過的父母。\n\n雷亞隨後來到她龍人血脈的家鄉克萊芬，又與冒險團隊被迫以間諜身份潛入她蜥蜴人血脈的家鄉萊斯諾，意外捲入政治鬥爭。雷亞所支持的新書院皮尼歐教授遇刺時，她跳上舞台試圖以醫藥技巧搶救教授，但教授胸口被炸開，衛兵也將她推開。秘書長瓦羅恩接掌新書院後，雷亞試圖與她激辯，卻被對方一指點到雙腿發麻而跪下。老樹盟派了立德上尉接觸雷亞，想利用其混血的身份為老樹盟站台；雷亞雖因父母線索而動搖，最後仍將立德給她的白金幣丟出窗外表明立場，並與拉比等人夜間追查老樹盟據點。",
    "record_en": "Leah joined the adventuring party and traveled from Batherdon to the Deepwood with Al-lon, Fur, Kaname, and Roel. In the Siren Graveyard battle, Leah cast Fog Cloud to limit visibility and joined the fight against the skeletons in melee.\n\nLeah later encountered T.I.D.E.S. and the Chosen gathering, learning about changes among the Obelisk and the organization's leadership. During the Storm of Mudtown, she learned the secret bargain among the Spring Spirit, the verdant mark, and the bandits, and also learned teachings of Nessis from a bandit priest. In the Rathanad Heir incident, she learned about her homeland from the silver dragon, and after Al-lon's parents were killed and Nylessa was judged, she sat with acting Dragon Crown Selamon and spoke about the parents she had never met.\n\nLeah then came to Clyphen, the homeland of her dragonborn bloodline. Afterward, Leah and the adventuring party were forced to infiltrate Leisnor, the homeland of her lizardfolk bloodline, as spies, unexpectedly becoming involved in a political struggle. When Professor Peneo of the New Academy, whom Leah supported, was assassinated, she jumped onto the stage and tried to save him with medical skill, but the professor's chest had been blown open and guards pushed her away. After Secretary-General Varoen took control of the New Academy, Leah tried to argue with her, but Varoen touched her with one finger and numbed her legs, causing her to kneel. The Old Tree League sent Captain Reid to contact Leah, hoping to use her mixed-blood identity to speak for the Old Tree League; although Leah wavered because of clues about her parents, she ultimately threw the platinum coins Captain Reid had given her out the window to declare her stance, then went with Ravi and the others at night to investigate an Old Tree League base."
  },
