    "record_zh": "安納戴克在麥克嵩篇後段加入主線，與隊伍一起進入王城上流社交圈，調查拉茲特獸、闇影之父與瑟巴諾相關線索。他在地下行動中面對火勢、爆炸與闇影之父造成的危機，曾身受重傷，由帕拉丁以治療法術救回；後來又被捲入角鬥士比武大會與麥丁頓王國的政治餘波。\n\n比武大會慘劇後，安納戴克與家亨、雷米離去後沒有回來。雷米後來宣稱三人遭到惡徒圍毆，只有自己逃出。隊伍沿城牆西北方找到安納戴克與家亨的遺體：安納戴克的身體被斬首，左手將家亨的頭按置在地上。眾人挖墓後將他與家亨安葬。",
    "record_en": "Anedak joined the main story in the later part of the Macksohn arc, entering the royal capital's upper-class circles with the party and investigating clues related to the Razte beast, the Father of Shadows, and Sebano. During underground operations, he faced fire, explosions, and the crisis caused by the Father of Shadows. He was badly wounded, and Paladin saved him with healing magic. Later, he was drawn into the gladiator tournament and the political aftermath of the Kingdom of Mattington.\n\nAfter the tragedy at the tournament, Anedak left with Jiaheng and Lemmy and did not return. Lemmy later claimed that the three had been surrounded and beaten by villains, and that only he escaped. The party found Anedak's and Jiaheng's bodies northwest along the city wall: Anedak's body had been decapitated, and his left hand had placed Jiaheng's head on the ground. The group dug a grave and buried him together with Jiaheng."
  },
