    "record_zh": "賽柏在卓茲蘭之穴篇加入冒險團隊，與 GoR、庫登、羅特、烏波等人面對孽物入門、芬諾爾傳道者與羽王。覆羽莊園後，他與羅特陪同烏波追尋出生地的直覺。\n\n在斐納札，賽柏以單音節化名「潤」行動，和羅特、烏波一起被要求穿上外來者衣服，進入溫室工作並搬土。用餐時，他勉強吃下乾草，但吃不下土，將自己的份給了烏波。鐘聲響起時，賽柏會自動跪下。月蝕之席後段，賽柏被化為巨蛇的芒果抓走而失蹤，只留下涅西斯聖徽給羅特；羅特握著那枚徽記，與烏波、巴斯沿著巨蛇痕跡追尋他的下落。\n\n常翠林成員幾天後趕走巨蛇，救下被綑綁且剛脫離昏迷的賽柏。被帶回常翠林後，賽柏在總部沉睡恢復，並於芒果襲擊時甦醒，以帶有涅西斯祝福的新武裝重返戰場，為派琶承受致命傷並給予芒果最後一擊。戰後，他決定留在常翠林，作為涅西斯理念的守護者。",
    "record_en": "Psyber joined the adventuring party in the Cave of Drogsland arc, facing the wretched creatures, Phynoir missionaries, and the Feather King together with GoR, Kudan, Lott, Ubbo, and others. After the Feathered Estate, he accompanied Lott in following Ubbo's intuition toward his birthplace.\n\nIn Fenadra, Psyber operated under the single-syllable alias \"Run.\" Along with Lott and Ubbo, he was required to wear outsiders' clothing, enter the greenhouse to work, and move soil. During a meal, he forced himself to eat hay, but could not eat soil, and gave his portion to Ubbo. When the bells rang, Psyber would automatically kneel. In the later part of the Seat of the Lunar Eclipse, Psyber was taken by Mango after Mango transformed into a giant serpent, leaving only his holy symbol of Nessis with Lott. Holding that symbol, Lott followed the serpent's trail with Ubbo and Buzz to search for him.\n\nMembers of the Evergreen later drove off the giant serpent and rescued Psyber, who had been bound and had only just emerged from unconsciousness. After being brought back to the Evergreen, Psyber slept and recovered at their headquarters, then awakened during Mango's attack and returned to battle with new arms blessed by Nessis. He took a fatal blow for Py'Par and delivered the final strike against Mango. After the battle, he chose to remain with the Evergreen as a guardian of Nessis's ideals."
  },
