    "record_zh": "墜兒先在麥丁頓餘波中與蘇加魯一同現身。家亨與安納戴克死後，她與帕拉丁爵士、蘇加魯分家前往瑟巴諾追查拉索斯教，名義上是為死去的夥伴復仇。之後在 Rugatha lite 的惡棍之城篇，她與帕拉丁、蘇加魯、圖伊特、華生同行。\n\n惡棍之城篇末段，墜兒在冒險者與霍布面前揭曉自己是拉索斯教間諜。她透過傳送法陣消失，沒有繼續與隊伍同行。",
    "record_en": "Drayer first appeared with Sugalu in the aftermath of Mattington. After Jiaheng and Anedak died, she split off with Syr Paladin and Sugalu to go to Sebano and investigate the Laxthos cult, nominally to avenge their dead companions. Later, in Rugatha lite's City of Villains arc, she traveled with Paladin, Sugalu, Tweeter, and Watson.\n\nIn the later part of the City of Villains arc, Drayer revealed before the adventurers and Hobb that she was a spy of the Laxthos cult. She vanished through a teleportation circle and did not continue traveling with the party."
