    "record_zh": "庫登在卓茲蘭之穴篇加入冒險團隊，與 GoR、羅特、賽柏、烏波等人一同接觸孽物、芬諾爾傳道者與羽王。這段旅程裡，隊伍從怪異生物與月神信仰的線索出發，逐漸走向覆羽莊園，也被迫理解王冠、羽僕與失控信仰之間的關係。\n\n在覆羽莊園，庫登面對失去理智前的時刻、被迫重演的過往命運、破碎天使，以及利希恩企圖掌握永恆與愛權能的儀式。當利希恩升神、莊園崩塌後，羅特、烏波、賽柏與 GoR 繼續往烏波直覺指向的地方前進；庫登則隨著覆羽莊園的崩塌消失了。",
    "record_en": "Kudan joined the adventuring party in the Cave of Drogsland arc, encountering the wretched creatures, Phynoir missionaries, and the Feather King together with GoR, Lott, Psyber, Ubbo, and others. During this journey, the party followed clues from strange creatures and moon-god worship toward the Feathered Estate, and was forced to understand the relationship among the crown, feather servants, and faith gone out of control.\n\nAt the Feathered Estate, Kudan faced the moments before losing reason, past fates forced to repeat themselves, the broken angel, and Lysien's ritual to seize the powers of eternity and love. After Lysien ascended and the estate collapsed, Lott, Ubbo, Psyber, and GoR continued toward the place indicated by Ubbo's intuition, while Kudan disappeared with the collapse of the Feathered Estate."
  },
