    "record_zh": "GoR 在卓茲蘭之穴篇加入冒險團，與庫登、羅特、賽柏、烏波等人面對孽物與芬諾爾傳道者。旅程一路將他帶到覆羽莊園；在那裡，GoR 面對岡斯與蘿絲的命運，也被利希恩要求思考是否以更沉重的靈魂取代岡斯。他一度坐上儀式座椅、戴上王冠，但神蹟最後落在利希恩身上，讓利希恩成為永恆與愛之神。\n\n覆羽莊園後，GoR 與羅特、烏波、賽柏沿著烏波的直覺前往其出生地。抵達目的地前一夜，GoR 在守夜中沒有留下任何訊息便消失。",
    "record_en": "GoR joined the adventuring party in the Cave of Drogsland arc, facing the wretched creatures and Phynoir missionaries together with Kudan, Lott, Psyber, Ubbo, and others. The journey eventually brought him to the Feathered Estate, where GoR faced the fate of Gons and Rose, and Lysien asked him to consider whether a heavier soul could replace Gons. GoR briefly sat in the ritual seat and wore the crown, but the miracle ultimately fell upon Lysien, making Lysien the god of eternity and love.\n\nAfter the Feathered Estate, GoR followed Ubbo's intuition toward Ubbo's birthplace together with Lott, Ubbo, and Psyber. On the night before they reached their destination, GoR disappeared during the night watch without leaving any message."
