    "record_zh": "賽希爾在 WILDS 的天選者集會篇客串登場。他以 T.I.D.E.S. 成員身份出席奢華盛宴與集結場合，與阿龍、毛毛、鑰、雷亞、羅羅等人同處一場揭露組織內部權力變化的宴會。當時隊伍已從里奇蒙爵士得知 T.I.D.E.S. 的組織結構，也開始理解方尖碑與天選者之間的關係。\n\n在集會中，眾人得知 T.I.D.E.S. 的編制與高層變動，也見到萊里被宣布不再是方尖碑成員與 T.I.D.E.S. 成員。被萊里邀請的冒險者也被要求離場，賽希爾則作為組織成員見證這場公開切割。",
    "record_en": "Cecil made a guest appearance in WILDS during the Chosen Gathering arc. As a member of T.I.D.E.S., she attended the luxurious feast and gathering alongside Al-lon, Fur, Kaname, Leah, Roel, and others, sharing a banquet that exposed changes in the organization's internal power structure. At that time, the party had already learned about T.I.D.E.S.'s organization through Syr Richmond, and was beginning to understand the relationship between the Obelisk and the Chosen.\n\nDuring the gathering, the group learned about T.I.D.E.S.'s organization and changes among its leadership, and also saw Riley announced as no longer being a member of the Obelisk or T.I.D.E.S. The adventurers invited by Riley were also asked to leave, while Cecil witnessed this public severing as a member of the organization."
