    "record_zh": "綠先生是 WILDS 的客串聖騎士，為萊里手下的員工，從土城風暴篇開始同行。他加入時，隊伍已接觸 T.I.D.E.S.、天選者與地方勢力，並開始被捲入土城周邊的政治與治安問題。綠先生協助隊伍處理春天精靈投票、翠綠印記與海雅特山山賊的真相，也見證阿龍在雨夜被土城議會逐出、剝奪姓氏。\n\n在拉撒拿繼承人篇，綠先生駕馬車帶隊前往拉撒拿，陪同阿龍接觸艾瑞里斯家、銀龍與龍人血脈的秘密。當阿龍父母遇害、奈梨莎罪行被揭發後，綠先生也在隊伍中見證阿龍以賽拉尼爾之名繼承龍冠，並宣判奈梨莎被逐出拉撒拿。送冒險者們離開拉撒拿後，綠先生便與中途之家道別，回去找 Riley。",
    "record_en": "Mr. Green was a guest paladin in WILDS and an employee under Riley. He began traveling with the party in the Storm of Mudtown arc. When he joined, the party had already encountered T.I.D.E.S., the Chosen, and local powers, and had begun to be drawn into political and public security problems around Mudtown. Mr. Green helped the party handle the truth behind the Spring Spirit vote, the verdant mark, and the Mount Hyatt bandits, and witnessed Al-lon being expelled from Mudtown and stripped of his surname on a rainy night before the council.\n\nIn the Rathanad Heir arc, Mr. Green drove the carriage that took the party to Rathanad, accompanying Al-lon as he encountered the Arylith family, the silver dragon, and secrets of dragonborn bloodline. After Al-lon's parents were killed and Nylessa's crime was exposed, Mr. Green witnessed Al-lon inherit the dragon crown under the name Selaniel and sentence Nylessa to exile from Rathanad. After seeing the adventurers off from Rathanad, Mr. Green said goodbye to Halfway House and returned to Riley."
